#. ~ Description of "cooked corn dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, dipped in batter and deep-fried.  Now that it's "
"been cooked, this corn dog tastes much better, but will spoil faster."
