"nutrition in an easy to carry form."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pemmican"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A concentrated mixture of fat and protein, first said to have been used as a "
"nutritious high-energy food by the Querecho and Teya people of what is Texas "
