#. ~ Description of "myopia contact lenses (weekly)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Small plastic case with two extended-wear soft contact lenses, buffered in "
"saline solution.  They are a great replacement for wearing glasses and sit "
"comfortably on the surface of the eye.  The lenses are designed to help "
"anyone with <color_light_blue>nearsightedness</color>, and should be "
"discarded after <color_light_blue>a week</color> of use."
msgstr ""

